      "title": "New twist in TVS family feud: Lakshmi Venu seeks partition of family assets",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/new-twist-in-tvs-family-feud-lakshmi-venu-seeks-partition-of-family-assets-126111601574_1.html",
      "description": "Backed by mother Mallika Srinivasan, Lakshmi Venu has sought a fair partition of family assets, challenging the 2024 settlement and alleging denial of her rightful share",
